      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="badge-bracket">[</span>
        Chief Scientist & Founding Engineer
        <span class="badge-bracket">]</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        I build systems<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">that last.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Where data meets uncertainty. Where the real test is not performance in isolation,
        but behavior over time. I design geospatial and AI systems that remain stable,
        correct, and maintainable under real operational pressure.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#work" class="btn btn-primary">View Work</a>
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=TcDAyj0AAAAJ&hl=en" 
