              <span class="system-tag">PIPELINE</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="system-title">End-to-End Geospatial Pipelines</h3>
            <p class="system-desc">
              Full lifecycle—ingestion, normalization, processing, verification, reporting, delivery.
              Designed to be repeatable, auditable, and resilient under scale.
            </p>
            <div class="tech-stack">
              <span class="tech">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="tech">PostGIS</span>
              <span class="tech">Python</span>
              <span class="tech">Docker</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="system-header">
              <div class="system-status">
                <span class="status-indicator">●</span>
                <span>ACTIVE</span>
              </div>
              <span class="system-tag">SENSING</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="system-title">Multimodal Remote Sensing Workflows</h3>
            <p class="system-desc">
              RGB imagery, thermal and infrared data, derived spatial layers. Extracting actionable
              signals while controlling uncertainty in operational environments.
            </p>
            <div class="tech-stack">
              <span class="tech">LiDAR</span>
              <span class="tech">Thermal</span>
              <span class="tech">Multispectral</span>
              <span class="tech">Point Clouds</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="system-header">
              <div class="system-status">
                <span class="status-indicator">●</span>
                <span>ACTIVE</span>
              </div>
              <span class="system-tag">QUALITY</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="system-title">Verification & Quality Control</h3>
            <p class="system-desc">
              Automated and human-in-the-loop verification layers that surface projection errors,
              alignment drift, and metadata assumptions before downstream impact.
            </p>
            <div class="tech-stack">
              <span class="tech">Validation</span>
              <span class="tech">QC Pipelines</span>
              <span class="tech">Monitoring</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="system-header">
              <div class="system-status">
                <span class="status-indicator">●</span>
                <span>ACTIVE</span>
              </div>
              <span class="system-tag">DELIVERY</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="system-title">Secure Data Delivery Architectures</h3>
            <p class="system-desc">
              Multi-tenant access control, lifecycle management, permission boundaries, and
              audit-friendly access patterns with strict tenant isolation.
            </p>
            <div class="tech-stack">
              <span class="tech">API Gateway</span>
              <span class="tech">Auth</span>
              <span class="tech">S3</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Research -->
    <section class="section" id="research">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="title-bracket">// </span>Research & Production
        </h2>
        <div class="research-content">
          <p class="text-large">
            My research background in remote sensing and geospatial analysis directly informs
            the systems I build. My peer-reviewed work addresses questions that recur in production:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-styled">
            <li>How spatial measurements behave under noise and scale</li>
            <li>How resolution and alignment affect downstream inference</li>
            <li>How to reason about uncertainty in derived spatial products</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-medium">
            I have authored and co-authored publications in journals and conferences, contributing
            methods and frameworks now embedded in production pipelines.
          </p>
          <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=TcDAyj0AAAAJ&hl=en" 
             target="_blank" class="link-arrow">
            View Google Scholar →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="section" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="title-bracket">// </span>Get in Touch
        </h2>
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div class="contact-card">
            <div class="contact-label">PRIMARY_EMAIL</div>
            <a href="mailto:nan.shang@droneinstitute.ai" class="contact-value">
              nan.shang@droneinstitute.ai
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <div class="contact-label">PERSONAL_EMAIL</div>
            <a href="mailto:sn1514826@gmail.com" class="contact-value">
              sn1514826@gmail.com
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <div class="contact-label">GITHUB</div>
            <a href="https://github.com/leibowivz" target="_blank" class="contact-value">
              github.com/leibowivz
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-content">
        <div class="footer-left">
          <div class="footer-name">Nan Shang, Ph.D.</div>
          <div class="footer-role">Chief Scientist & Founding Engineer, Drone Institute</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-right">
          <a href="https://github.com/leibowivz" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=TcDAyj0AAAAJ&hl=en" target="_blank">Scholar</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // ASCII Horizon Animation
    const canvas = document.getElementById('ascii-canvas');
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');

    let width, height, cols, rows;
    const chars = ['░', '▒', '▓', '█', '▄', '▀', '▌', '▐', '│', '─', '┼', '┤', '├', '┴', '┬', '╱', '╲', '╳'];
    const horizon = [];
    let time = 0;

    function resize() {
      width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
      height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;
      cols = Math.floor(width / 12);
      rows = Math.floor(height / 20);
      
      // Initialize horizon
      for (let i = 0; i < cols; i++) {
        horizon[i] = Math.floor(rows * 0.6) + Math.sin(i * 0.1) * 5;
      }
    }

    function getSpectralColor(x, y, t) {
      const hue = ((x / cols) * 360 + (y / rows) * 60 + t * 20) % 360;
      const saturation = 70;
      const lightness = 30 + (y / rows) * 20;
      return `hsl(${hue}, ${saturation}%, ${lightness}%)`;
    }

    function draw() {
      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)';
      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);

      ctx.font = '16px "SF Mono", Monaco, monospace';
      ctx.textAlign = 'center';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';

      time += 0.01;

      // Update horizon
      for (let i = 0; i < cols; i++) {
        const wave1 = Math.sin(i * 0.05 + time * 2) * 3;
        const wave2 = Math.sin(i * 0.03 - time * 1.5) * 2;
        const wave3 = Math.sin(i * 0.08 + time * 3) * 1.5;
        horizon[i] = Math.floor(rows * 0.6) + wave1 + wave2 + wave3;
      }

      // Draw ASCII horizon
      for (let x = 0; x < cols; x++) {
        for (let y = 0; y < rows; y++) {
          const horizonY = horizon[x];
          
          if (y > horizonY - 2 && y < horizonY + 8) {
            const density = Math.abs(y - horizonY) / 8;
            const charIndex = Math.floor(density * chars.length);
            const char = chars[Math.min(charIndex, chars.length - 1)];
            
            const color = getSpectralColor(x, y, time);
            const alpha = 1 - density * 0.7;
            
            ctx.fillStyle = color;
            ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;
            
            const screenX = x * 12;
            const screenY = y * 20;
            
            ctx.fillText(char, screenX, screenY);
          }
        }
      }

      ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
      requestAnimationFrame(draw);
    }

    window.addEventListener('resize', resize);
    resize();
    draw();
  </script>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    :root {
      --black: #000000;
      --gray-800: #1a1a1a;
      --gray-700: #2a2a2a;
      --gray-500: #737373;
      --gray-400: #a3a3a3;
      --white: #ffffff;
      
      --cyan: #00f0ff;
      --purple: #a855f7;
      --pink: #ec4899;
      --green: #22c55e;
      
      --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: "SF Mono", Monaco, "Cascadia Code", monospace;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ASCII Canvas */
    #ascii-canvas {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    /* Container */
    .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    /* Navigation */
    .nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .nav-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--cyan);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .logo:hover {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: var(--gray-400);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 12rem 0 8rem;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--gray-400);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .badge-bracket {
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
        #00f0ff 0%, 
        #a855f7 25%, 
        #ec4899 50%, 
        #f97316 75%, 
        #22c55e 100%
      );
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      background-size: 200% auto;
      animation: spectral 3s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes spectral {
      0% { background-position: 0% center; }
      100% { background-position: 200% center; }
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--gray-400);
      max-width: 720px;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 0;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: inline-block;
      border: 2px solid;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--cyan);
      color: var(--black);
      border-color: var(--cyan);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--white);
      border-color: var(--gray-700);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--cyan);
      color: var(--cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
    }

    /* Stats */
    .stats {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--cyan);
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03);
    }

    .stat {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
      position: relative;
    }

    .stat:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .stat::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
        #00f0ff 0%, 
        #a855f7 50%, 
        #ec4899 100%
      );
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--purple));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--gray-500);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    /* Main */
    .main {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .title-bracket {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    /* Grid */
    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    /* Card */
    .card {
      padding: 2rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border: 1px solid var(--gray-700);
      transition: all 0.3s;
      position: relative;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
        var(--cyan) 0%, 
        var(--purple) 50%, 
        var(--pink) 100%
      );
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      border-color: var(--cyan);
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .card-number {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--cyan);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card-text {
      color: var(--gray-400);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* Systems */
    .systems {
      display: grid;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .system-card {
      padding: 2rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border: 1px solid var(--gray-700);
      transition: all 0.3s;
      position: relative;
    }

    .system-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
        var(--cyan) 0%, 
        var(--green) 100%
      );
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }

    .system-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--cyan);
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .system-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .system-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .system-status {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .status-indicator {
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.5; }
    }

    .system-tag {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--gray-500);
    }

    .system-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .system-desc {
      color: var(--gray-400);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .tech-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .tech {
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: var(--cyan);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* Research */
    .research-content {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .text-large {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--gray-400);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .list-styled {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .list-styled li {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--gray-400);
      position: relative;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }

    .list-styled li::before {
      content: ">";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    .text-medium {
      color: var(--gray-400);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .link-arrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--cyan);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      transition: gap 0.2s;
    }

    .link-arrow:hover {
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    /* Contact */
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .contact-card {
      padding: 2rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
